#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:115
#: f69b695e6edd4b7da350b4bfdfc3b434
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use MyST-flavored Markdown. **Never nest `` ``` `` fences inside `` "
"```{admonition} ``** — that breaks zh_CN rendering. Use colon fences "
"(`:::`) when an admonition must contain a code block, and wrap examples "
"of fences in a 4-backtick outer fence:"
msgstr ""
"使用 MyST 风格的 Markdown。**切勿在 `` ```{admonition} `` 内部嵌套 `` ``` `` "
"围栏**——这会破坏 zh_CN 渲染。当提示框需要包含代码块时，请使用冒号围栏（`:::`）；展示围栏语法的示例请用 4 个反引号作为外层围栏："

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:117
#: b74dc0a998774d73bbddef53cb5bcada
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"
msgstr ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"

