"Use fenced code blocks with language. **Do not use unlabeled** `` ``` `` "
"**fences** for ASCII diagrams or directory trees — sphinx-intl turns "
"those into RST `::` and Chinese HTML leaks a bare `::`. Use a colon fence"
" instead:"
